. Rounds: walls cut from 12 m to 8 m so the cutaway reads; reception wall enlarged; sheer shortened; the round bar is a low dark drum that still merges with the dark floor in the render (only the birch above it reads). Guessed: plan positions of every object (photos give no plan), room 24 x 16 m, the coffered ceiling, curtains and the fair hall's walls are left out."}